# The build context should be a few hundred KB of source. Without this file it
# would be over 200 MB — node_modules and a populated ephem/ — uploaded to the
# daemon on every build, to be discarded by stages that fetch their own.
#
# ephem/ in particular must never be sent: the image's copy comes from the
# ephemeris stage, which verifies every checksum. A developer's local
# directory, with whatever profile and whatever partial state it is in, is not
# the same thing and must not be able to leak in.
node_modules
dist
ephem
coverage
reports
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
tests
docs
*.md
*.log
.DS_Store

# LICENSE is deliberately absent from this list: the runtime stage ships it.

# The ephemeris stage copies exactly one script; the rest are dev tooling.
scripts/*
!scripts/fetch-ephemeris.ts
